00:30:51,840 --> 00:31:09,600
Yeah, it's it was it was fun for us to do like a second app in the sense with Spectre just to see like, oh, what would it be like to do something now with the knowledge of having bumbled our way into Hollow Eye and like kind of pretending like to know what we were doing.

