00:50:02,800 --> 00:50:10,960
But we do need recurring revenue for that, like we can't survive on one person giving us the equivalent of three dollars years and years and years ago.

566
00:50:11,440 --> 00:50:24,400
We would have to either do some really crazy stuff to optimize for growth, which would destroy the product as you know it, or we would have to abandon the app and then keep making new apps, because there really are no good paths for paid upgrades in the app store.

567
00:50:24,880 --> 00:50:28,640
Was Spectre an experiment into that or was that a totally separate thing?

